Better refactor: after traitIds loop, if isOrWithModifiers, iterate modifiers and encode each as modifier with its own id/traits/pairs, and `continue` (skip pair block on Or itself).
But note `Or` also has `traits` (direct traits). We should encode direct traits too. Existing code does traitIds. Then recurse nested.

